WEBVTT

00:14:58.276 --> 00:15:02.276
And it's because of what I spoke about
a few minutes ago,

00:15:02.276 --> 00:15:08.276
this kind of decrease in chronic
inflammation and chronic stress.

00:15:08.276 --> 00:15:11.956
And so what we find is
that -- we can't guarantee

00:15:11.996 --> 00:15:15.436
that any one person
is going to stay happier or live longer

00:15:15.476 --> 00:15:17.116
if they have better relationships,

00:15:17.116 --> 00:15:19.236
but we find that there are
these ingredients,

00:15:19.236 --> 00:15:21.396
just like taking care of your health --

00:15:21.396 --> 00:15:25.556
you know, not smoking,
not abusing alcohol or drugs,

00:15:25.556 --> 00:15:27.556
exercising regularly,

00:15:27.556 --> 00:15:29.476
getting regular health care,

00:15:29.476 --> 00:15:31.236
having access to health care.